User Stories – Travel Planner

As a user, I want to enter my travel details (such as country, number of travelers, and travel period), so that the suggested itinerary fits my planned trip. (Priority: High)

As a user, I want to enter traveler characteristics (such as ages and fitness levels), so that the suggested activities match our physical abilities. (Priority: High)

As a user, I want to specify my preferences (for example, culture, adventure, relaxation, or nature), so that the itinerary aligns with our interests. (Priority: High)

As a user, I want to receive an automatically generated, optimized itinerary, so that I get a complete travel plan without needing to research everything myself. (Priority: High)

As a user, I want to adjust my input (such as preferences, period, or fitness level) after seeing the first proposal, so that I can refine the results to better suit my needs. (Priority: Medium)

As a user, I want to save, download, and share the itinerary, so that I can use it offline and coordinate with other travelers. (Priority: Medium)

Travel Agency

As a travel agency, I want to provide and update destination and activity data in the database (such as tags for difficulty, activity type, and age suitability), so that the generated itineraries remain accurate and relevant. (Priority: Low)